 r←closeList arg;c
⍝ Space-separated names of the clones whose onClose hook has fired, oldest
⍝ first. Read under the same :Hold that onClose writes under, since the
⍝ writer runs on EWC's Listen thread while readers are session threads.

 :Hold 'MTESTLOG'
     c←#.mtestlog.closed
 :EndHold

 :If 0=≢c
     r←'(none)'
 :Else
     r←1↓∊' ',¨c
 :EndIf
